              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 9,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "# Liquibase migration review"
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 10,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 11,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "Use this skill when a change touches Liquibase changelogs (`db/changelog/**`)."
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 12,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 13,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "## Procedure"
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 14,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 15,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "1. Find the master changelog and confirm every new changeset is included from it."
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 16,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "2. For each new changeset, check the items in [the checklist](references/checklist.md)."
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 17,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "3. Never edit a changeset that may already be applied. Add a new one instead."
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 18,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "4. Confirm each changeset has a `rollback` or is explicitly marked irreversible"
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 19,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "   with a reason in its `comment`."
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 20,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "5. Flag locking risks: adding `NOT NULL` columns without defaults, building"
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 21,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "   indexes on large tables without `CONCURRENTLY` (PostgreSQL), renames."
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 22,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "6. Summarize findings as: blocking issues, risks, suggestions."
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 23,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "tag": "removed",
                "oldLine": 24,
                "newLine": null,
                "text": "## Output"
